title: Ponder_TopicHub
---
<<SetShot "Wide">>

<<if PonderTurnsLeft() == 0>>
    <<jump Ponder_End>>
<<endif>>

<<if HasPonderTopics() == false>>
    <<jump Ponder_End>>
<<endif>>

<<PreparePonderTopics 3>>

-> Ponder {PonderTopicDisplayName(0)} <<if HasPreparedPonderTopic(0)>>
    <<detour {SelectPonderTopic(0)}>>
    <<CountPonderTurn>>
-> Ponder {PonderTopicDisplayName(1)} <<if HasPreparedPonderTopic(1)>>
    <<detour {SelectPonderTopic(1)}>>
    <<CountPonderTurn>>
-> Ponder {PonderTopicDisplayName(2)} <<if HasPreparedPonderTopic(2)>>
    <<detour {SelectPonderTopic(2)}>>
    <<CountPonderTurn>>
-> Think of something else <<if CanRefreshPonderTopics()>>
    Prince: No. There is something else on my mind.
    <<TakePonderTurn>>
    <<jump Ponder_TopicHub>>
-> Stop pondering
    Prince: I have thought enough for now.
    <<jump Ponder_End>>

<<jump Ponder_TopicHub>>
===
